s a remote promise and returns retained value context. Initiator instead raises both promise and value ballot before self report. Matching Prepare replies fill a recovery quorum; maximum value ballot selects history, then status determines committed retention, Accept or restarted PreAccept. Master role assignment enables retry behavior but is not exclusive proposal ownership. Lower-ballot requests and mismatched replies are filtered; already queued messages remain independently dispatched.',['B-authority','B-select','B-recover-trigger','B-transport'],['F-value'],['S-recovery','S-exec-recovery','S-dispatch']),connection=path('The same local command/status/value-ballot record is both formed by proposal/accept/commit and consumed by later authority acquisition. Recovery is meant to carry eligible prior support into new formation: accepted selection re-enters Accept, committed selection stays committed, other selection restarts phase 1. Default execution detects stalled known instances and enqueues recovery. Local committed guards protect some old decisions, but report production/selection determines whether a new owner discovers another replica\\\\'s decision. This producer-consumer distinction supplies the first question.',['B-propose','B-accept','B-commit','B-authority','B-select','B-recover-trigger'],['F-value','F-decision'],['S-phase1','S-accept','S-commit','S-recovery','S-exec-recovery']),core_gaps=[],open_details=['Legal recovery history discriminating self-report promotion from prior committed support remains to construct.','Independent quorum, Accept status, optional persistence and SCAN leads remain sourced surfaces.'],rationale='Both core relationships and their connection are traced through read handlers, actual transport dispatch, recovery trigger, membership inputs and execution consumer. Local anomalies remain explicit; usable is navigation readiness, not correctness.'))\nq=dict(question='Can recovery initiation promote its own stale or empty value report