loration can distinguish actual preservation from masking; this is more direct than testing quorum variants or optional persistence now.',disposition='concrete_suspicion',preferred_check='controlled_schedule')\njson.dump(mapx,open('map.json','w'),indent=2)\njson.dump(dict(action='continue',rationale='Register the two-core implementation backbone and first sourced recovery preservation question; no formal defect or execution evidence claimed.',sources=sources,map_path='map.json',question=q),open('submission.json','w'),indent=2)\nPY\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python build_submission.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
